---------------------------- MODULE TwoPhaseCommitTraces ----------------------------
(* The recorded runs of the Java nodes of two-phase commit, one state per step in the model's   *)
(* variables, generated by net.terminalvalue.quorum.twopc.Traces from its scripted scenarios.   *)
(* TwoPhaseCommitTrace.tla checks each against the model. Do not edit: regenerate it with       *)
(* java -cp build/main:build/test net.terminalvalue.quorum.twopc.Traces > spec/TwoPhaseCommitTraces.tla *)
EXTENDS Sequences

Names == <<
    "every participant votes yes, and the coordinator commits",
    "one participant votes no, and the coordinator aborts once every vote is in",
    "a vote is late, and the coordinator aborts on its timer",
    "a participant gives up without voting, and the coordinator aborts on its timer",
    "the coordinator crashes while collecting, and restarts with the presumed abort",
    "the coordinator crashes after logging the commit and before the broadcast, and restarts",
    "the coordinator crashes after logging the abort its timer decided, and restarts",
    "a restart is itself cut short by a crash, and the next one finishes it",
    "a participant crashes after voting yes, restarts holding its locks, and learns the decision",
    "a participant crashes before voting, restarts aborted, and the coordinator aborts on its timer",
    "a participant crashes after logging its yes and before sending it, and the timer aborts"
>>

